  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Phthalates</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>Fragrance Family: </b>Fresh<b><br></b><br><b>Key Notes: </b>Bergamot, Jasmine, Sandalwood<b><br><br>Fragrance Description:</b> This head-turning hair and body mist is sweet and sultry. A bright burst of bergamot awakens the senses, intertwining with an irresistible blend of delicate jasmine and warm sugar. Lust-worthy hints of amber, moss, and sandalwood feel softly sensual. The scent that leaves you wanting more.<b><br></b><br><b>About the Bottle:</b> A chic silhouette designed to elevate any vanity. Clean and simple lines contrast the glamour of rose-gold mirrored details—PATRICK TA’s forever signature. It's effortless elegance that matches the mood of the fragrance it holds.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply at any moment throughout the day. Spritz hair and body for a luxurious refresh.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol, Water (Aqua), Fragrance (Parfum), PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Trideceth-9, Phenoxyethanol, Propylene Glycol, Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Citrate, Citric Acid</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fresh Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Phthalates</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Floral Scent</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>Fragrance Family: </b>Fresh<b><br></b><br><b>Key Notes: </b>Bergamot, Jasmine, Sandalwood<b><br><br>Fragrance Description:</b> This head-turning hair and body mist is sweet and sultry. A bright burst of bergamot awakens the senses, intertwining with an irresistible blend of delicate jasmine and warm sugar. Lust-worthy hints of amber, moss, and sandalwood feel softly sensual. The scent that leaves you wanting more.<b><br></b><br><b>About the Bottle:</b> A chic silhouette designed to elevate any vanity. Clean and simple lines contrast the glamour of rose-gold mirrored details—PATRICK TA’s forever signature. It's effortless elegance that matches the mood of the fragrance it holds.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply at any moment throughout the day. Spritz hair and body for a luxurious refresh.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol, Water (Aqua), Fragrance (Parfum), PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Trideceth-9, Phenoxyethanol, Propylene Glycol, Tetrasodium Glutamate Diacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Citrate, Citric Acid</div></details>",
